    </section>

    <section class="space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-3xl">Materials Cloud@HPC Board</h2>
      <hr class="border-t border-gray-300 mb-6" />
      <h3>
        The Materials Cloud@HPC Board, created in late 2020, is currently formed
